<title>FRANCE: New York top destination for Paris June 97 cargo exports.</title>
<headline>New York top destination for Paris June 97 cargo exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paris airports authority(ADP) said New York was the top export destination from Charles de Gaulle and Orly in June 1997.</p>
<p>The top ten destinations for ADP exports in June 1997, in tonnes with the percentage change on June 1996, were as follows:</p>
<p>	 Origin	  June '97    June '96</p>
<p>			   tonnes	Pct Change</p>
<p>    1. New York	3,695	down   7.0</p>
<p>    2. Hong Kong     2,636	up    17.1</p>
<p>    3. Chicago	 2,532	down   7.5</p>
<p>    4. Tokyo	   2,184	down   0.4</p>
<p>    5. Sao Paulo     1,224	up    38.3</p>
<p>    6. Mexico City   1,064	up     4.1</p>
<p>    7. Singapore     1,044	up    28.5</p>
<p>    8. Montreal	  918	up    20.6</p>
<p>    9. Los Angeles     900	down  27.5</p>
<p>   10. Miami	     811	down  20.8</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
